N5008 [dcl.decl]/4, [conv.bool]: a class template partial specialization matched
on a function type with a reference return and no parameters (fn<int&()>, the
shape of std::function<exprt&()> in util/expr_iterator.h) provides an explicit
operator bool used in a boolean context.  Requires the empty () after the
reference return to be parsed as a function parameter-list.  assertion.2 FAILURE
proves non-vacuity.
